  <entry>
    <title>Vue 3 Composition API 实战指南</title>
    <link href="/2025/10/23/Vue-3-Composition-API-%E5%AE%9E%E6%88%98%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97/"/>
    <url>/2025/10/23/Vue-3-Composition-API-%E5%AE%9E%E6%88%98%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97/</url>
    
    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<h2 id="前言"><a href="#前言" class="headerlink" title="前言"></a>前言</h2><p>Vue 3 的 Composition API 是 Vue.js 框架的一个重要更新，它提供了一种更灵活的方式来组织和重用组件逻辑。相比于 Vue 2 的 Options API，Composition API 允许开发者更好地组织代码，提高代码的可读性和可维护性。</p><p>在本篇文章中，我们将通过实际示例来学习 Composition API 的核心概念和使用方法，并探讨如何在实际项目中应用这些知识。</p><h2 id="Composition-API-简介"><a href="#Composition-API-简介" class="headerlink" title="Composition API 简介"></a>Composition API 简介</h2><p>Composition API 是 Vue 3 中引入的一种新的组件组织方式。它基于函数式编程的思想，允许我们将相关的逻辑组织在一起，而不是按照选项（如 data、methods、computed 等）来分割。</p><h3 id="与-Options-API-的对比"><a href="#与-Options-API-的对比" class="headerlink" title="与 Options API 的对比"></a>与 Options API 的对比</h3><p>让我们先看看两种 API 的区别：</p><figure class="highlight javascript"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br><span class="line">19</span><br><span class="line">20</span><br><span class="line">21</span><br><span class="line">22</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs javascript"><span class="hljs-comment">// Options API</span><br><span class="hljs-keyword">export</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">default</span> &#123;<br>  <span class="hljs-title function_">data</span>(<span class="hljs-params"></span>) &#123;<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> &#123;<br>      <span class="hljs-attr">count</span>: <span class="hljs-number">0</span>,<br>      <span class="hljs-attr">todoList</span>: []<br>    &#125;<br>  &#125;,<br>  <span class="hljs-attr">methods</span>: &#123;<br>    <span class="hljs-title function_">increment</span>(<span class="hljs-params"></span>) &#123;<br>      <span class="hljs-variable language_">this</span>.<span class="hljs-property">count</span>++<br>    &#125;,<br>    <span class="hljs-title function_">addTodo</span>(<span class="hljs-params">todo</span>) &#123;<br>      <span class="hljs-variable language_">this</span>.<span class="hljs-property">todoList</span>.<span class="hljs-title function_">push</span>(todo)<br>    &#125;<br>  &#125;,<br>  <span class="hljs-attr">computed</span>: &#123;<br>    <span class="hljs-title function_">doubleCount</span>(<span class="hljs-params"></span>) &#123;<br>      <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> <span class="hljs-variable language_">this</span>.<span class="hljs-property">count</span> * <span class="hljs-number">2</span><br>    &#125;<br>  &#125;<br>&#125;<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>同样的功能使用 Composition API 实现：</p><figure class="highlight javascript"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br><span class="line">19</span><br><span class="line">20</span><br><span class="line">21</span><br><span class="line">22</span><br><span class="line">23</span><br><span class="line">24</span><br><span class="line">25</span><br><span class="line">26</span><br><span class="line">27</span><br><span class="line">28</span><br><span class="line">29</span><br><span class="line">30</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs javascript"><span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> &#123; ref, computed &#125; <span class="hljs-keyword">from</span> <span class="hljs-string">&#x27;vue&#x27;</span><br><br><span class="hljs-keyword">export</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">default</span> &#123;<br>  <span class="hljs-title function_">setup</span>(<span class="hljs-params"></span>) &#123;<br>    <span class="hljs-comment">// 响应式数据</span><br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">const</span> count = <span class="hljs-title function_">ref</span>(<span class="hljs-number">0</span>)<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">const</span> todoList = <span class="hljs-title function_">ref</span>([])<br>    <br>    <span class="hljs-comment">// 方法</span><br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">const</span> <span class="hljs-title function_">increment</span> = (<span class="hljs-params"></span>) =&gt; &#123;<br>      count.<span class="hljs-property">value</span>++<br>    &#125;<br>    <br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">const</span> <span class="hljs-title function_">addTodo</span> = (<span class="hljs-params">todo</span>) =&gt; &#123;<br>      todoList.<span class="hljs-property">value</span>.<span class="hljs-title function_">push</span>(todo)<br>    &#125;<br>    <br>    <span class="hljs-comment">// 计算属性</span><br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">const</span> doubleCount = <span class="hljs-title function_">computed</span>(<span class="hljs-function">() =&gt;</span> count.<span class="hljs-property">value</span> * <span class="hljs-number">2</span>)<br>    <br>    <span class="hljs-comment">// 暴露给模板</span><br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> &#123;<br>      count,<br>      todoList,<br>      increment,<br>      addTodo,<br>      doubleCount<br>    &#125;<br>  &#125;<br>&#125;<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="核心概念详解"><a href="#核心概念详解" class="headerlink" title="核心概念详解"></a>核心概念详解</h2><h3 id="1-setup-函数"><a href="#1-setup-函数" class="headerlink" title="1. setup() 函数"></a>1. setup() 函数</h3><p><a href="file:///D:/文件/me%20project/个人博客/blog/node_modules/@vue/runtime-core/dist/runtime-core.d.ts#L1035-L1035">setup()</a> 函数是 Composition API 的入口点，它在组件创建之前执行，一旦 props 被解析完成，它将作为组合式 API 的起点。</p><figure class="highlight javascript"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs javascript"><span class="hljs-keyword">export</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">default</span> &#123;<br>  <span class="hljs-attr">props</span>: &#123;<br>    <span class="hljs-attr">title</span>: <span class="hljs-title class_">String</span><br>  &#125;,<br>  <span class="hljs-title function_">setup</span>(<span class="hljs-params">props, context</span>) &#123;<br>    <span class="hljs-comment">// props 是响应式的，但不能解构</span><br>    <span class="hljs-variable language_">console</span>.<span class="hljs-title function_">log</span>(props.<span class="hljs-property">title</span>)<br>    <br>    <span class="hljs-comment">// context 包含了 attrs、slots、emit 等属性</span><br>    context.<span class="hljs-title function_">emit</span>(<span class="hljs-string">&#x27;event&#x27;</span>, <span class="hljs-string">&#x27;data&#x27;</span>)<br>    <br>    <span class="hljs-comment">// 返回值将暴露给模板和其他选项式 API 钩子</span><br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> &#123;<br>      <span class="hljs-comment">// 需要暴露的数据和方法</span><br>    &#125;<br>  &#125;<br>&#125;<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="2-响应式数据"><a href="#2-响应式数据" class="headerlink" title="2. 响应式数据"></a>2. 响应式数据</h3><p>在 Composition API 中，我们使用 <a href="file:///D:/文件/me%20project/个人博客/blog/node_modules/@vue/reactivity/dist/reactivity.d.ts#L297-L297">ref</a> 和 <a href="file:///D:/文件/me%20project/个人博客/blog/node_modules/@vue/reactivity/dist/reactivity.d.ts#L356-L356">reactive</a> 来创建响应式数据：</p><figure class="highlight javascript"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs javascript"><span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> &#123; ref, reactive &#125; <span class="hljs-keyword">from</span> <span class="hljs-string">&#x27;vue&#x27;</span><br><br><span class="hljs-comment">// ref 用于基本类型</span><br><span class="hljs-keyword">const</span> count = <span class="hljs-title function_">ref</span>(<span class="hljs-number">0</span>)<br><span class="hljs-variable language_">console</span>.<span class="hljs-title function_">log</span>(count.<span class="hljs-property">value</span>) <span class="hljs-comment">// 0</span><br><br><span class="hljs-comment">// reactive 用于对象和数组</span><br><span class="hljs-keyword">const</span> state = <span class="hljs-title function_">reactive</span>(&#123;<br>  <span class="hljs-attr">name</span>: <span class="hljs-string">&#x27;Vue&#x27;</span>,<br>  <span class="hljs-attr">list</span>: []<br>&#125;)<br><br><span class="hljs-comment">// ref 在模板中会自动解包</span><br><span class="hljs-comment">// &#123;&#123; count &#125;&#125; 而不是 &#123;&#123; count.value &#125;&#125;</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="3-计算属性和监听器"><a href="#3-计算属性和监听器" class="headerlink" title="3. 计算属性和监听器"></a>3. 计算属性和监听器</h3><figure class="highlight javascript"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs javascript"><span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> &#123; ref, computed, watch &#125; <span class="hljs-keyword">from</span> <span class="hljs-string">&#x27;vue&#x27;</span><br><br><span class="hljs-keyword">const</span> count = <span class="hljs-title function_">ref</span>(<span class="hljs-number">0</span>)<br><br><span class="hljs-comment">// 计算属性</span><br><span class="hljs-keyword">const</span> doubleCount = <span class="hljs-title function_">computed</span>(<span class="hljs-function">() =&gt;</span> count.<span class="hljs-property">value</span> * <span class="hljs-number">2</span>)<br><br><span class="hljs-comment">// 监听器</span><br><span class="hljs-title function_">watch</span>(count, <span class="hljs-function">(<span class="hljs-params">newVal, oldVal</span>) =&gt;</span> &#123;<br>  <span class="hljs-variable language_">console</span>.<span class="hljs-title function_">log</span>(<span class="hljs-string">`count changed from <span class="hljs-subst">$&#123;oldVal&#125;</span> to <span class="hljs-subst">$&#123;newVal&#125;</span>`</span>)<br>&#125;)<br><br><span class="hljs-comment">// 监听多个数据源</span><br><span class="hljs-title function_">watch</span>([count, doubleCount], <span class="hljs-function">(<span class="hljs-params">[newCount, newDoubleCount], [oldCount, oldDoubleCount]</span>) =&gt;</span> &#123;<br>  <span class="hljs-comment">// 处理变化</span><br>&#125;)<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="实战示例：用户信息管理组件"><a href="#实战示例：用户信息管理组件" class="headerlink" title="实战示例：用户信息管理组件"></a>实战示例：用户信息管理组件</h2><p>让我们通过一个完整的示例来展示 Composition API 的实际应用：</p><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br><span class="line">19</span><br><span class="line">20</span><br><span class="line">21</span><br><span class="line">22</span><br><span class="line">23</span><br><span class="line">24</span><br><span class="line">25</span><br><span class="line">26</span><br><span class="line">27</span><br><span class="line">28</span><br><span class="line">29</span><br><span class="line">30</span><br><span class="line">31</span><br><span class="line">32</span><br><span class="line">33</span><br><span class="line">34</span><br><span class="line">35</span><br><span class="line">36</span><br><span class="line">37</span><br><span class="line">38</span><br><span class="line">39</span><br><span class="line">40</span><br><span class="line">41</span><br><span class="line">42</span><br><span class="line">43</span><br><span class="line">44</span><br><span class="line">45</span><br><span class="line">46</span><br><span class="line">47</span><br><span class="line">48</span><br><span class="line">49</span><br><span class="line">50</span><br><span class="line">51</span><br><span class="line">52</span><br><span class="line">53</span><br><span class="line">54</span><br><span class="line">55</span><br><span class="line">56</span><br><span class="line">57</span><br><span class="line">58</span><br><span class="line">59</span><br><span class="line">60</span><br><span class="line">61</span><br><span class="line">62</span><br><span class="line">63</span><br><span class="line">64</span><br><span class="line">65</span><br><span class="line">66</span><br><span class="line">67</span><br><span class="line">68</span><br><span class="line">69</span><br><span class="line">70</span><br><span class="line">71</span><br><span class="line">72</span><br><span class="line">73</span><br><span class="line">74</span><br><span class="line">75</span><br><span class="line">76</span><br><span class="line">77</span><br><span class="line">78</span><br><span class="line">79</span><br><span class="line">80</span><br><span class="line">81</span><br><span class="line">82</span><br><span class="line">83</span><br><span class="line">84</span><br><span class="line">85</span><br><span class="line">86</span><br><span class="line">87</span><br><span class="line">88</span><br><span class="line">89</span><br><span class="line">90</span><br><span class="line">91</span><br><span class="line">92</span><br><span class="line">93</span><br><span class="line">94</span><br><span class="line">95</span><br><span class="line">96</span><br><span class="line">97</span><br><span class="line">98</span><br><span class="line">99</span><br><span class="line">100</span><br><span class="line">101</span><br><span class="line">102</span><br><span class="line">103</span><br><span class="line">104</span><br><span class="line">105</span><br><span class="line">106</span><br><span class="line">107</span><br><span class="line">108</span><br><span class="line">109</span><br><span class="line">110</span><br><span class="line">111</span><br><span class="line">112</span><br><span class="line">113</span><br><span class="line">114</span><br><span class="line">115</span><br><span class="line">116</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs vue">&lt;template&gt;<br>  &lt;div class=&quot;user-profile&quot;&gt;<br>    &lt;h2&gt;&#123;&#123; userInfo.name &#125;&#125; 的个人资料&lt;/h2&gt;<br>    &lt;div class=&quot;user-info&quot;&gt;<br>      &lt;p&gt;姓名: &#123;&#123; userInfo.name &#125;&#125;&lt;/p&gt;<br>      &lt;p&gt;年龄: &#123;&#123; userInfo.age &#125;&#125;&lt;/p&gt;<br>      &lt;p&gt;邮箱: &#123;&#123; userInfo.email &#125;&#125;&lt;/p&gt;<br>      &lt;p&gt;技能: &#123;&#123; skills.join(&#x27;, &#x27;) &#125;&#125;&lt;/p&gt;<br>      &lt;p&gt;经验值: &#123;&#123; experience &#125;&#125; (&#123;&#123; experienceLevel &#125;&#125;)&lt;/p&gt;<br>    &lt;/div&gt;<br>    &lt;div class=&quot;actions&quot;&gt;<br>      &lt;button @click=&quot;incrementAge&quot;&gt;增加年龄&lt;/button&gt;<br>      &lt;button @click=&quot;addSkill&quot;&gt;添加技能&lt;/button&gt;<br>      &lt;button @click=&quot;gainExperience&quot;&gt;获取经验&lt;/button&gt;<br>    &lt;/div&gt;<br>  &lt;/div&gt;<br>&lt;/template&gt;<br><br>&lt;script&gt;<br>import &#123; ref, reactive, computed, watch &#125; from &#x27;vue&#x27;<br><br>export default &#123;<br>  name: &#x27;UserProfile&#x27;,<br>  setup() &#123;<br>    // 用户基本信息<br>    const userInfo = reactive(&#123;<br>      name: &#x27;张三&#x27;,<br>      age: 25,<br>      email: &#x27;zhangsan@example.com&#x27;<br>    &#125;)<br>    <br>    // 技能列表<br>    const skills = ref([&#x27;JavaScript&#x27;, &#x27;HTML&#x27;, &#x27;CSS&#x27;])<br>    <br>    // 经验值<br>    const experience = ref(1000)<br>    <br>    // 计算属性：经验等级<br>    const experienceLevel = computed(() =&gt; &#123;<br>      if (experience.value &lt; 1000) return &#x27;新手&#x27;<br>      if (experience.value &lt; 5000) return &#x27;熟练&#x27;<br>      if (experience.value &lt; 10000) return &#x27;专家&#x27;<br>      return &#x27;大师&#x27;<br>    &#125;)<br>    <br>    // 方法<br>    const incrementAge = () =&gt; &#123;<br>      userInfo.age++<br>    &#125;<br>    <br>    const addSkill = () =&gt; &#123;<br>      const newSkill = prompt(&#x27;请输入新技能:&#x27;)<br>      if (newSkill &amp;&amp; !skills.value.includes(newSkill)) &#123;<br>        skills.value.push(newSkill)<br>      &#125;<br>    &#125;<br>    <br>    const gainExperience = () =&gt; &#123;<br>      const gained = Math.floor(Math.random() * 100) + 50<br>      experience.value += gained<br>    &#125;<br>    <br>    // 监听器：当经验值超过特定值时提示<br>    watch(experience, (newExp, oldExp) =&gt; &#123;<br>      if (Math.floor(oldExp / 1000) !== Math.floor(newExp / 1000)) &#123;<br>        alert(`恭喜你达到了 $&#123;experienceLevel.value&#125; 等级!`)<br>      &#125;<br>    &#125;)<br>    <br>    // 返回需要在模板中使用的数据和方法<br>    return &#123;<br>      userInfo,<br>      skills,<br>      experience,<br>      experienceLevel,<br>      incrementAge,<br>      addSkill,<br>      gainExperience<br>    &#125;<br>  &#125;<br>&#125;<br>&lt;/script&gt;<br><br>&lt;style scoped&gt;<br>.user-profile &#123;<br>  padding: 20px;<br>  border: 1px solid #ddd;<br>  border-radius: 8px;<br>  max-width: 600px;<br>  margin: 0 auto;<br>&#125;<br><br>.user-info p &#123;<br>  margin: 10px 0;<br>  padding: 5px 0;<br>  border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;<br>&#125;<br><br>.actions &#123;<br>  margin-top: 20px;<br>&#125;<br><br>.actions button &#123;<br>  margin-right: 10px;<br>  padding: 8px 16px;<br>  background-color: #42b983;<br>  color: white;<br>  border: none;<br>  border-radius: 4px;<br>  cursor: pointer;<br>&#125;<br><br>.actions button:hover &#123;<br>  background-color: #359c6d;<br>&#125;<br>&lt;/style&gt;<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="自定义组合函数"><a href="#自定义组合函数" class="headerlink" title="自定义组合函数"></a>自定义组合函数</h2><p>Composition API 的一个重要优势是能够创建可复用的逻辑。让我们创建一个自定义组合函数来管理用户的地理位置信息：</p><figure class="highlight javascript"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br><span class="line">19</span><br><span class="line">20</span><br><span class="line">21</span><br><span class="line">22</span><br><span class="line">23</span><br><span class="line">24</span><br><span class="line">25</span><br><span class="line">26</span><br><span class="line">27</span><br><span class="line">28</span><br><span class="line">29</span><br><span class="line">30</span><br><span class="line">31</span><br><span class="line">32</span><br><span class="line">33</span><br><span class="line">34</span><br><span class="line">35</span><br><span class="line">36</span><br><span class="line">37</span><br><span class="line">38</span><br><span class="line">39</span><br><span class="line">40</span><br><span class="line">41</span><br><span class="line">42</span><br><span class="line">43</span><br><span class="line">44</span><br><span class="line">45</span><br><span class="line">46</span><br><span class="line">47</span><br><span class="line">48</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs javascript"><span class="hljs-comment">// composables/useGeolocation.js</span><br><span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> &#123; ref, onMounted, onUnmounted &#125; <span class="hljs-keyword">from</span> <span class="hljs-string">&#x27;vue&#x27;</span><br><br><span class="hljs-keyword">export</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">function</span> <span class="hljs-title function_">useGeolocation</span>(<span class="hljs-params"></span>) &#123;<br>  <span class="hljs-keyword">const</span> location = <span class="hljs-title function_">ref</span>(<span class="hljs-literal">null</span>)<br>  <span class="hljs-keyword">const</span> error = <span class="hljs-title function_">ref</span>(<span class="hljs-literal">null</span>)<br>  <span class="hljs-keyword">let</span> watcher = <span class="hljs-literal">null</span><br><br>  <span class="hljs-keyword">const</span> <span class="hljs-title function_">getLocation</span> = (<span class="hljs-params"></span>) =&gt; &#123;<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> (!navigator.<span class="hljs-property">geolocation</span>) &#123;<br>      error.<span class="hljs-property">value</span> = <span class="hljs-string">&#x27;Geolocation is not supported by your browser&#x27;</span><br>      <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span><br>    &#125;<br><br>    watcher = navigator.<span class="hljs-property">geolocation</span>.<span class="hljs-title function_">watchPosition</span>(<br>      <span class="hljs-function"><span class="hljs-params">position</span> =&gt;</span> &#123;<br>        location.<span class="hljs-property">value</span> = &#123;<br>          <span class="hljs-attr">latitude</span>: position.<span class="hljs-property">coords</span>.<span class="hljs-property">latitude</span>,<br>          <span class="hljs-attr">longitude</span>: position.<span class="hljs-property">coords</span>.<span class="hljs-property">longitude</span>,<br>          <span class="hljs-attr">accuracy</span>: position.<span class="hljs-property">coords</span>.<span class="hljs-property">accuracy</span>,<br>          <span class="hljs-attr">timestamp</span>: position.<span class="hljs-property">timestamp</span><br>        &#125;<br>        error.<span class="hljs-property">value</span> = <span class="hljs-literal">null</span><br>      &#125;,<br>      <span class="hljs-function"><span class="hljs-params">err</span> =&gt;</span> &#123;<br>        error.<span class="hljs-property">value</span> = err.<span class="hljs-property">message</span><br>        location.<span class="hljs-property">value</span> = <span class="hljs-literal">null</span><br>      &#125;,<br>      &#123;<br>        <span class="hljs-attr">enableHighAccuracy</span>: <span class="hljs-literal">true</span>,<br>        <span class="hljs-attr">timeout</span>: <span class="hljs-number">5000</span>,<br>        <span class="hljs-attr">maximumAge</span>: <span class="hljs-number">0</span><br>      &#125;<br>    )<br>  &#125;<br><br>  <span class="hljs-title function_">onMounted</span>(<span class="hljs-function">() =&gt;</span> &#123;<br>    <span class="hljs-title function_">getLocation</span>()<br>  &#125;)<br><br>  <span class="hljs-title function_">onUnmounted</span>(<span class="hljs-function">() =&gt;</span> &#123;<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> (watcher) &#123;<br>      navigator.<span class="hljs-property">geolocation</span>.<span class="hljs-title function_">clearWatch</span>(watcher)<br>    &#125;<br>  &#125;)<br><br>  <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> &#123; location, error &#125;<br>&#125;<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>在组件中使用这个自定义组合函数：</p><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br><span class="line">19</span><br><span class="line">20</span><br><span class="line">21</span><br><span class="line">22</span><br><span class="line">23</span><br><span class="line">24</span><br><span class="line">25</span><br><span class="line">26</span><br><span class="line">27</span><br><span class="line">28</span><br><span class="line">29</span><br><span class="line">30</span><br><span class="line">31</span><br><span class="line">32</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs vue">&lt;template&gt;<br>  &lt;div class=&quot;location-info&quot;&gt;<br>    &lt;h3&gt;地理位置信息&lt;/h3&gt;<br>    &lt;div v-if=&quot;error&quot; class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;<br>      错误: &#123;&#123; error &#125;&#125;<br>    &lt;/div&gt;<br>    &lt;div v-else-if=&quot;location&quot; class=&quot;location&quot;&gt;<br>      &lt;p&gt;纬度: &#123;&#123; location.latitude &#125;&#125;&lt;/p&gt;<br>      &lt;p&gt;经度: &#123;&#123; location.longitude &#125;&#125;&lt;/p&gt;<br>      &lt;p&gt;精度: &#123;&#123; location.accuracy &#125;&#125; 米&lt;/p&gt;<br>      &lt;p&gt;更新时间: &#123;&#123; new Date(location.timestamp).toLocaleString() &#125;&#125;&lt;/p&gt;<br>    &lt;/div&gt;<br>    &lt;div v-else&gt;<br>      正在获取位置信息...<br>    &lt;/div&gt;<br>  &lt;/div&gt;<br>&lt;/template&gt;<br><br>&lt;script&gt;<br>import &#123; useGeolocation &#125; from &#x27;@/composables/useGeolocation&#x27;<br><br>export default &#123;<br>  setup() &#123;<br>    const &#123; location, error &#125; = useGeolocation()<br>    <br>    return &#123;<br>      location,<br>      error<br>    &#125;<br>  &#125;<br>&#125;<br>&lt;/script&gt;<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="最佳实践"><a href="#最佳实践" class="headerlink" title="最佳实践"></a>最佳实践</h2><h3 id="1-逻辑组织"><a href="#1-逻辑组织" class="headerlink" title="1. 逻辑组织"></a>1. 逻辑组织</h3><p>将相关的逻辑组织在一起，例如将用户相关的所有状态和方法放在一个函数中：</p><figure class="highlight javascript"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br><span class="line">19</span><br><span class="line">20</span><br><span class="line">21</span><br><span class="line">22</span><br><span class="line">23</span><br><span class="line">24</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs javascript"><span class="hljs-comment">// composables/useUser.js</span><br><span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> &#123; ref, computed, watch &#125; <span class="hljs-keyword">from</span> <span class="hljs-string">&#x27;vue&#x27;</span><br><span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> &#123; useGeolocation &#125; <span class="hljs-keyword">from</span> <span class="hljs-string">&#x27;./useGeolocation&#x27;</span><br><br><span class="hljs-keyword">export</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">function</span> <span class="hljs-title function_">useUser</span>(<span class="hljs-params"></span>) &#123;<br>  <span class="hljs-keyword">const</span> user = <span class="hljs-title function_">ref</span>(<span class="hljs-literal">null</span>)<br>  <span class="hljs-keyword">const</span> isLoggedIn = <span class="hljs-title function_">computed</span>(<span class="hljs-function">() =&gt;</span> !!user.<span class="hljs-property">value</span>)<br>  <br>  <span class="hljs-keyword">const</span> <span class="hljs-title function_">login</span> = <span class="hljs-keyword">async</span> (<span class="hljs-params">credentials</span>) =&gt; &#123;<br>    <span class="hljs-comment">// 登录逻辑</span><br>    user.<span class="hljs-property">value</span> = <span class="hljs-keyword">await</span> <span class="hljs-title function_">authenticate</span>(credentials)<br>  &#125;<br>  <br>  <span class="hljs-keyword">const</span> <span class="hljs-title function_">logout</span> = (<span class="hljs-params"></span>) =&gt; &#123;<br>    user.<span class="hljs-property">value</span> = <span class="hljs-literal">null</span><br>  &#125;<br>  <br>  <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> &#123;<br>    user,<br>    isLoggedIn,<br>    login,<br>    logout<br>  &#125;<br>&#125;<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="2-响应式数据的使用"><a href="#2-响应式数据的使用" class="headerlink" title="2. 响应式数据的使用"></a>2. 响应式数据的使用</h3><figure class="highlight javascript"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs javascript"><span class="hljs-comment">// 正确：使用 .value 访问 ref 的值</span><br><span class="hljs-keyword">const</span> count = <span class="hljs-title function_">ref</span>(<span class="hljs-number">0</span>)<br><span class="hljs-variable language_">console</span>.<span class="hljs-title function_">log</span>(count.<span class="hljs-property">value</span>)<br><br><span class="hljs-comment">// 正确：在模板中 ref 会自动解包</span><br><span class="hljs-comment">// &lt;p&gt;&#123;&#123; count &#125;&#125;&lt;/p&gt;</span><br><br><span class="hljs-comment">// 错误：直接解构会失去响应性</span><br><span class="hljs-keyword">const</span> &#123; count &#125; = <span class="hljs-title function_">useSomeComposable</span>() <span class="hljs-comment">// count 不再是响应式的</span><br><br><span class="hljs-comment">// 正确：使用 toRefs 保持响应性</span><br><span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> &#123; toRefs &#125; <span class="hljs-keyword">from</span> <span class="hljs-string">&#x27;vue&#x27;</span><br><span class="hljs-keyword">const</span> &#123; count &#125; = <span class="hljs-title function_">toRefs</span>(<span class="hljs-title function_">useSomeComposable</span>())<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="总结"><a href="#总结" class="headerlink" title="总结"></a>总结</h2><p>Composition API 为 Vue.js 开发带来了更灵活和强大的组件组织方式。通过本文的介绍和示例，你应该已经掌握了：</p><ol><li>Composition API 的基本概念和与 Options API 的区别</li><li>如何使用 <a href="file:///D:/文件/me%20project/个人博客/blog/node_modules/@vue/runtime-core/dist/runtime-core.d.ts#L1035-L1035">setup()</a> 函数</li><li>响应式数据、计算属性和监听器的使用</li><li>如何创建可复用的自定义组合函数</li><li>Composition API 的最佳实践</li></ol><p>在实际项目中，合理使用 Composition API 可以显著提高代码的可维护性和可读性，特别是在处理复杂组件逻辑时。希望这篇文章能帮助你更好地理解和应用 Vue 3 的 Composition API。</p>]]></content>
    
    
